        "\"\"\"\n",
        "TRANSITION:\n",
        "\n",
        "If multiple trees improve performance,\n",
        "the next question is:\n",
        "\n",
        "How do we make sure each tree is different?\n",
        "\n",
        "Answer:\n",
        "We train each tree on a slightly different dataset.\n",
        "This is called BOOTSTRAPPING.\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "BOOTSTRAPPING:\n",
        "\n",
        "Each tree is trained on a random sample of the data\n",
        "(with replacement).\n",
        "\n",
        "Result:\n",
        "- Some data points appear multiple times\n",
        "- Some are missing (out-of-bag)\n",
        "\n",
        "This creates diversity between trees,\n",
        "which is essential for a strong ensemble.\n",
        "\"\"\""
